            "detailed_description": "{REVAMP AVAILABLE} Kalymn Nox is the Albino Hunter (the hunter with albinism); even his pretentious and slightly racist title can't keep him from waking up broke after a night of drinking. Join him as he takes on various jobs throughout the land which include:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Spontaneous Engagement<br />\r\n-A Telepathic Lizard<br />\r\n-A Witch with a Poorly Insulated Castle<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd hey! That was just in the Demo alone! The Full Version will include various additional plot lines, an updated Battle System, more Party Members, and even an Interdimensional Mini-Game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRecommended Age: 14+<br />\r\n<br />\r\n{EDIT}<br />\r\nThere is a revamped version of this game available which includes a lot more features, achievements, and overall more polished content. There are various reasons why the revamp exists as its own separate form, which are too lengthy to go over here. However, I have left this old version up in the event that someone (A) out there might want to compare and contrast the two versions, (B) cannot afford the newer version, or (C) simply wants to play this version for the sake of nostalgia. I also don't want to risk taking this game down in the event that the legacy users would lose their money and/or the product. So please take this into consideration before deciding to purchase either game. :)",
